# Codic - UML Diagram Editor

## Project Overview
React + TypeScript UML diagram editor with drag-and-drop canvas, inline editing, and Java code generation. Uses ReactFlow (@xyflow/react) for the diagram canvas, Supabase for auth/persistence, and Vite for bundling.

## Tech Stack
- React 19, TypeScript 6, Vite 8
- @xyflow/react v12 (ReactFlow)
- Supabase (auth, DB)
- Prisma (schema, not actively used in frontend)
- Zustand (available, not heavily used)
- Lucide React (icons)

## Architecture
```
src/
  App.tsx              - Main app: Editor component (canvas, inspector, panels)
  component/
    UmlNodeCard.tsx    - ReactFlow node component with inline editing
    Auth.tsx           - Login/signup/OTP pages
    ProjectExplorer.tsx- Folder/project tree sidebar
    AddNode.tsx        - Reference/example component (not used in main app)
    edges/
      InheritanceEdge.tsx  - Custom edge with triangle marker
      CompositionEdge.tsx  - Custom edge with diamond marker
  lib/
    supabase.ts        - Supabase client, auth helpers, CRUD for projects/folders
    AuthContext.tsx     - React auth provider
    useAuth.ts         - Auth context hook
    umlFactory.ts      - Factory functions for UML nodes/members
    ids.ts             - ID generation utility
    codegen/
      parser.ts        - Text-to-UML node parser
      java.ts          - Java code generator from UML diagram
  types/
    uml.ts             - TypeScript types (UmlNode, UmlEdge, UmlMember, etc.)
```

## Key Types (src/types/uml.ts)
- `UmlNodeKind`: 'class' | 'interface' | 'enum' | 'abstract'
- `UmlMember`: { id, visibility, name, type, isStatic?, isAbstract? }
- `UmlNodeData`: { kind, name, packageName?, fields, methods, enumValues? }
- `UmlNode`: Node<UmlNodeData, 'umlNode'> (ReactFlow Node)
- `UmlRelationKind`: 'association' | 'aggregation' | 'composition' | 'inheritance' | 'implementation' | 'dependency'
- `UmlEdge`: Edge<UmlEdgeData> (ReactFlow Edge)
- `DiagramSnapshot`: { id?, folderId?, name, nodes, edges, updatedAt }

## Conventions
- Use `createMember()` and `createUmlNode()` from `lib/umlFactory.ts` for UML entities
- Use `createId()` from `lib/ids.ts` for generating unique IDs
- Node type is always `'umlNode'` for ReactFlow registration
- Edge types: `'inheritance'`, `'composition'`, `'smoothstep'` (default)
- Visibility: 'public' | 'private' | 'protected' | 'package' with symbols +, -, #, ~
- Use `useNodesState` / `useEdgesState` from @xyflow/react for node/edge state
- Theme toggling via `data-theme` attribute on `<html>` and localStorage key `uml:theme`

## Environment Variables
- `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` - Supabase project URL
- `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` - Supabase anonymous key
- If both are set, Supabase auth/persistence is used; otherwise falls back to localStorage

## Commands
- `npm run dev` - Start dev server
- `npm run build` - TypeScript check + Vite build
- `npm run lint` - ESLint
